From 9d6a2d4f0c0a916f7b1d5c5257fb688334a0ef16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicholas Smith <nsmith@tenstorrent.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:13:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [feat] Opt-in prefill sampling mask for chunked prefill

agentic-models patch P2 (vllm-tt-plugin-prefill-sampling-mask.patch).

A model declaring model_capabilities['supports_prefill_sampling_mask']=True
receives prefill_forward(prefill_sampling_mask=[...]) (True = final row) on
every route, and a submission with intermediate rows is no longer forced onto
host sampling for it. Base: m5 c018beb F1 (config helper, boolean validation,
input_batch, model_runner, platform, docs) and tests/test_prefill_sampling_mask.py.
c018beb's state-slot change (F2) is not taken here (P1 covers it, gated), nor
its test_tile_size / bad_words / reasoning test edits.

Without the declaration the routing, the prefill call and the lane
device-output assert are the f6fe76b ones (the assert is kept verbatim on the
undeclared path).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
