@@ -56,9 +57,29 @@ Resume prefill can replay generated tokens to rebuild KV state.
 
 The model adapter returns host logits `[B, 1, V]` for host sampling, or sampled
 token IDs for device sampling. The plugin has no separate prefill readback
-hook. `TTModelRunner` suppresses output for intermediate prefill chunks and
-selects host sampling when a submitted prefill contains intermediate chunks,
-so intermediate chunks must not advance a device sampler.
+hook. `TTModelRunner` suppresses output for intermediate prefill chunks.
+Without `supports_prefill_sampling_mask=True`, it selects host sampling when a
+submitted prefill contains intermediate chunks, so they do not advance the
+device sampler. Existing model calls and routing remain unchanged.
+
+With `supports_prefill_sampling_mask=True`, the plugin passes the inverse of
+its intermediate-row mask in submitted row order, independent of `empty_slots`.
+An unchunked/final-only submission receives all `True`. This declaration permits
+an otherwise device-eligible mixed batch to remain on the device sampler; it
+does not enable device sampling or override host-only features such as logprobs,
+penalties, token filters, or structured-prefill requirements.
+
+The adapter must process every row's scheduled tokens and preserve its resulting
+KV/recurrent state. For a `False` row, it must skip terminal-logit readback and
+must not sample, advance that request's RNG, or overwrite its resident sampled
+token. For `True` rows it follows the selected device or host sampling contract.
+Device output still has one token/placeholder row per submitted row; the plugin
+suppresses masked placeholders. Host output retains `[B, 1, V]` row order, with
+host-created placeholders for intermediate rows and actual logits read only for
+final rows. Existing host sampling protects intermediate request generators and
+suppresses their outputs. An all-intermediate step has no token to sample.
+Models must validate mask length and boolean values, preserve off-batch state,
+and prepare every supported masked execution shape before trace capture.
 
