+  `TTModelInput.intermediate_prefill_mask` and report `[]` in the
+  `ModelRunnerOutput` instead of a sampled token. By default, they force the
+  step onto host sampling and get a generator clone so their request RNG does
+  not drift. A model declaring `supports_prefill_sampling_mask=True` receives
+  the inverse mask as `prefill_sampling_mask` and preserves intermediate token
+  and RNG state itself; otherwise device-eligible batches then stay on device.
